WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.728
Confirm the exact school and record. This uses the real app editor with synthetic training records. Check the school, family or employee before changing a field.

00:00:10.728 --> 00:00:21.400
Use the correct receipt type. Open Cash payment only for cash actually received. This is not a substitute for a pending card or ACH payment.

00:00:21.400 --> 00:00:32.072
Enter the receipt evidence. Use the verified amount and unique receipt reference. Check recent activity for an existing entry.

00:00:32.072 --> 00:00:42.744
Review the received date and notes. Use the actual received date in school time. Preserve enough detail for reconciliation.

00:00:42.744 --> 00:00:53.842
Review before saving. After an authorized save, verify one payment entry, the balance and any invoice allocation. No cash payment is recorded here.

